    "instruction": "Write the strongest small adaptive investigation program you can. Inspect the whole parent code and public native contract. Seek a legal input on which the parent disagrees with the native source. Use code inspection, examples, receipts, stateful testing and boundaries freely. Avoid duplicate queries; null stops. Up to eight native query slots are available. You may include a brief note useful for a later repair. No particular decomposition is required.",
